asr-000113
00:27:56.880 --> 00:28:02.880
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: through a process that was open transparent and accountable to the filipino people

asr-000114
00:28:02.880 --> 00:28:04.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Alinsunod sa panawagan ng ating mga

asr-000115
00:28:04.720 --> 00:28:06.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: kababayan na mas maging bukas ang

asr-000116
00:28:06.800 --> 00:28:08.800
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: proseso ng pagbuo ng

asr-000117
00:28:08.800 --> 00:28:10.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: budget?

asr-000118
00:28:10.400 --> 00:28:17.420
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Matagumpay pong sinimulan ng inyong kongreso noong nakaraang taon ang mga mahahalagang

asr-000119
00:28:17.420 --> 00:28:24.540
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: reforma. We enacted a series of structural reforms that placed transparency, accountability,

asr-000120
00:28:25.140 --> 00:28:31.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and public participation at the center of our budget process. We abolished the small committee

asr-000121
00:28:31.240 --> 00:28:38.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and established the first ever Budget Amendments Review Subcommittee, or BARC. The BARC's over

asr-000122
00:28:38.400 --> 00:28:45.240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: 20 hours of deliberations were live-streamed and amendments were approved and shown line

asr-000123
00:28:45.240 --> 00:28:51.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: by line to the Filipino public. Moreover, all committee hearings and plenary deliberations

asr-000124
00:28:51.020 --> 00:28:57.780
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: were live-streamed. We enhanced engagement with civil society organizations and conducted

asr-000125
00:28:57.780 --> 00:29:03.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the first ever People's Budget Review. For the first time in recent history, the period

asr-000126
00:29:03.460 --> 00:29:08.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of amendments was open to all House members, and all amendments were incorporated.

asr-000127
00:29:08.400 --> 00:29:14.700
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Before the HGAB second reading approval. And finally, for the first time in history,

asr-000128
00:29:15.300 --> 00:29:21.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: the Bicameral Conference Committee proceedings were open to the public. The BICAM six days

asr-000129
00:29:21.280 --> 00:29:26.460
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: of deliberations were all live-streamed, and amendments were shown to the Filipino public

asr-000130
00:29:26.460 --> 00:29:34.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: line by line. Sinalamin po ng mga mahahalagang reformang ito ang paninindigan ng inyong kongreso

asr-000131
00:29:34.400 --> 00:29:38.380
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: na tanggalin ang tabing sa usaping budget at talagang

asr-000132
00:29:38.400 --> 00:29:44.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at talagang ipakita kung saan napupunta ang bawat piso ng buwis na mula sa dugo at

asr-000133
00:29:44.400 --> 00:29:53.180
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pawis ng bawat Pilipino. Ang ating mga magagandang nasimulan noong nakaraang taon. Ipagpapatuloy at

asr-000134
00:29:53.180 --> 00:29:59.400
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: at pagbubutihin pa po natin sa pagbuo ng budget para sa taong 2027.

asr-000135
00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:10.280
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For 2027, President Ferdinand Bongbong Marcos Jr. has proposed a budget anchored on people-centered

asr-000136
00:30:10.280 --> 00:30:14.360
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: growth for an inclusive and resilient future.

asr-000137
00:30:14.360 --> 00:30:21.240
