asr-001720
02:00:37.880 --> 02:00:46.900
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We have also prepared a short video presentation to provide an overview of the administration's priority programs, activities, and projects,

asr-001721
02:00:47.240 --> 02:00:50.480
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: all crafted and funded for the Filipino people.

asr-001722
02:00:51.120 --> 02:00:57.840
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Before I end my presentation, allow me to echo the President's call during the latest State of the Nation Address.

asr-001723
02:00:57.840 --> 02:01:07.740
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Sa nalalabing dalawang taon ng administrasyon, tatapusin natin ang mga nasimulan at tutuparin ang ating pangako sa sambayanan.

asr-001724
02:01:08.300 --> 02:01:12.640
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: That instruction is also reflected in how we crafted this budget.

asr-001725
02:01:13.200 --> 02:01:20.300
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: We made sure that this 7.2 trillion budget only funds what is necessary, what is ready,

asr-001726
02:01:20.500 --> 02:01:23.680
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: and what can deliver the greatest benefit to our people.

asr-001727
02:01:24.240 --> 02:01:32.600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Every peso that we propose to spend must have a clear purpose, a sound basis, and an intended result for the Filipino people.

asr-001728
02:01:33.320 --> 02:01:40.600
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: The DBM remains committed to funding the government's priorities and to ensuring that this budget delivers on its promises

asr-001729
02:01:40.600 --> 02:01:47.100
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: through utmost transparency, accountability, fiscal discipline, and integrity.

asr-001730
02:01:47.100 --> 02:01:50.400
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Because for us, DBM now stands for...

asr-001731
02:01:50.500 --> 02:01:58.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Dapat budget ay makatao, dapat ang budget ay maaasahan, dapat ang budget ay malinis.

asr-001732
02:01:58.360 --> 02:02:08.360
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Dahil ang budget na makatao, maaasahan, at malinis ay isang budget na mapapakinabangan ng bawat mamamayan, pati na ng susunod na henerasyon.

asr-001733
02:02:09.280 --> 02:02:10.380
Acting DBM Secretary Kim Robert C. De Leon: Maraming salamat po.

