asr-001839
02:09:21.940 --> 02:09:25.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Mas modernong kakayahan para sa pambansang depensa at siguridad.

asr-001840
02:09:25.940 --> 02:09:29.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Mas mahusay na paghahanda laban sa mga kalamidad.

asr-001841
02:09:29.940 --> 02:09:33.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Mas mabilis at mas epesyente ang serbisyo ng pamahalaan

asr-001842
02:09:33.940 --> 02:09:38.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: sa pamamagitan ng digitalisasyon at mas malalakas na lokal na pamahalaan.

asr-001843
02:09:38.940 --> 02:09:43.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Sa tulong ng mas mataas na national tax allotment at suporta sa BARB.

asr-001844
02:09:43.940 --> 02:09:49.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Dahil ang bawat pamumuhunan ngayon ay nagiging pundasyon ng mas magandang bukas.

asr-001845
02:09:49.940 --> 02:09:55.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Ang paghahanda ng panukalang national budget ay bunga ng maingat na pagsusuri,

asr-001846
02:09:55.940 --> 02:09:59.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: masusing pagpaplano at malawak na konsultasyon.

asr-001847
02:09:59.940 --> 02:10:07.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Ngayon, ang panukalang 2027 National Budget ay inihaharap sa Kongreso upang dumaan sa masusing pagtalakay.

asr-001848
02:10:08.940 --> 02:10:12.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: bilang bahagi ng ating demokratikong proseso.

asr-001849
02:10:12.940 --> 02:10:24.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Isang mahalagang hakbang upang matiyak na ang bawat pisong ipinagkakatiwala ng sambayanan ay mailalaan sa mga programang tunay na magpapabuti sa buhay ng mga Pilipino.

asr-001850
02:10:24.940 --> 02:10:29.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: My beloved countrymen, let us continue the work that we have started.

asr-001851
02:10:29.940 --> 02:10:33.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: To make the Philippines the country that Filipinos deserve.

asr-001852
02:10:33.940 --> 02:10:37.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: There is no nobler cause than this.

asr-001853
02:10:38.940 --> 02:10:40.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: We do this for our children.

asr-001854
02:10:40.940 --> 02:10:42.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: We do this for our future.

asr-001855
02:10:42.940 --> 02:10:48.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: We can but do this because we love our country and we love our people.

asr-001856
02:10:48.940 --> 02:10:51.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Maliwanag ang bili ng ating Pangulo.

asr-001857
02:10:51.940 --> 02:10:57.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Ang pondo ng bayan ay dapat napapakinabangan ng bawat pamamayan.

asr-001858
02:10:57.940 --> 02:11:07.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Kaya ang bawat pisong nakapaloob sa panukalang fiscal year 2027 National Budget ay dumaan sa masusing pagsusuri,

asr-001859
02:11:07.940 --> 02:11:17.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: upang matiyak na ito ay nakalaan sa mga programang may malinaw na layunin at may tunay na pakinabang sa buhay ng mga Pilipino.

asr-001860
02:11:17.940 --> 02:11:22.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Ngunit ang ating pananagutan ay hindi nagtatakos sa paghahanda ng budget.

asr-001861
02:11:22.940 --> 02:11:26.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Dito pa lamang nagsisimula ang mas mahalagang kongkuli.

asr-001862
02:11:26.940 --> 02:11:35.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: Ang tiyakin ang bawat pondo na ipinagkatiwala ng taong bayan ay nagiging mga proyektong na ipatutupad,

asr-001863
02:11:35.940 --> 02:11:42.940
Government Budget Presentation Narrator: mga serbisyong na ihahatid at mga pagbabagong tunay na nararamdaman ng bawat Pilipino.

asr-001864
02:11:42.940 --> 02:11:48.940
